###Block: Descriptions
Create Chosen One.MOD	DESC:Turn a normal human (max 3 level or hd) into a maddened, murderous creature.
Create Crawling Claw.MOD	DESC:Create a number of crawling claw.
Create Darkenbeast.MOD	DESC:Transmute a small or medium animal with no more than 2 HD into a darkenbeast.

###Block: Other modifications
